WEBVTT

00:14.700 --> 00:17.500
♪The Upper Three hold the seals♪

00:17.540 --> 00:21.380
♪A valiant general, an opera star, and a ruthless cripple♪

00:21.980 --> 00:24.420
♪The Middle Three stir the clouds♪

00:24.500 --> 00:29.140
♪A fiend, a wandering hero, and a master of the blade♪

00:30.540 --> 00:33.220
♪The Lower Three deal in gold♪

00:33.540 --> 00:37.500
♪A beauty, a seer, and a scholar♪

00:37.860 --> 00:40.780
♪The Upper, Middle, and Lower Three♪

00:41.620 --> 00:49.300
♪Represent the nine houses of old Changsha♪

00:49.900 --> 00:51.380
♪Together, they are known♪

00:52.060 --> 00:56.660
♪As the Mystic Nine♪

01:25.660 --> 01:31.900
[Mystic Nine]
[Adapted from the novel of Kennedy Xu]

01:32.060 --> 01:34.980
[Episode 5]
[This story is purely fictional]

02:15.960 --> 02:17.570
How many times have you whistled now?

02:18.560 --> 02:19.260
Are you sure it works?

02:19.430 --> 02:21.290
Do you know why we call him Xiaoyu?

02:23.030 --> 02:24.540
Master Zhang calls him Xiaoyu

02:24.680 --> 02:26.410
because his Wedge Formation is as sharp as a blade

02:26.840 --> 02:29.360
and his Fish-scale Formation is as tough as a turtle.

02:29.360 --> 02:31.160
I don't care what he is.

02:31.870 --> 02:32.980
We still can't save the victim.

02:33.120 --> 02:33.930
I should do it myself.

02:34.150 --> 02:36.060
Let me finish.

02:36.960 --> 02:37.530
Know this.

02:37.960 --> 02:39.820
- When Master Zhang was investigating the sea mine smuggling...
- Tiezui!

02:40.560 --> 02:41.320
Master Zhang.

02:49.910 --> 02:51.680
Master Zhang, what's wrong?

02:52.960 --> 02:53.860
I want you

02:54.480 --> 02:56.250
to tell me everything

02:56.600 --> 02:57.950
that has happened since we entered

02:58.200 --> 02:58.800
the Otherworld Tower.

03:09.000 --> 03:09.860
Why are you hiding here?

03:14.670 --> 03:15.540
What happened?

03:19.190 --> 03:20.580
I saw a palanquin just now.

03:24.160 --> 03:25.170
Why are you so shocked?

03:26.160 --> 03:27.700
Perhaps the dust there is poisonous.

03:28.600 --> 03:30.350
After what you've been through, what do you think?

03:36.630 --> 03:38.000
Everything feels contrived.

03:39.070 --> 03:39.570
Think about it.

03:40.160 --> 03:41.120
The things I care about most

03:41.560 --> 03:42.700
are my mates and my dogs.

03:43.880 --> 03:45.010
Then, they vanished one by one

03:45.010 --> 03:45.990
before my eyes.

03:46.950 --> 03:48.450
Zhang Qishan cares about his men the most.

03:49.070 --> 03:50.450
So, it took away Unit 401.

03:51.510 --> 03:53.380
This tower is taking away the things everyone cares about the most.

03:53.950 --> 03:54.450
Xiangu.

03:55.910 --> 03:58.020
If it wants to torture you,

03:59.190 --> 04:00.820
will it take me away?

04:06.000 --> 04:07.100
Don't be so full of yourself.

04:07.560 --> 04:08.610
It didn't take you away.

04:09.040 --> 04:10.890
That means you are not the most important person to me.

04:11.880 --> 04:12.980
It didn't take me away.

04:13.350 --> 04:15.050
That means I'm also not

04:15.880 --> 04:16.740
the one you care about most.

04:17.160 --> 04:17.740
Nonsense.

04:18.840 --> 04:20.700
That only means it doesn't know me well.

04:21.990 --> 04:22.890
I've told you this.

04:24.040 --> 04:25.500
If it dares hurt you, even by a little,

04:26.110 --> 04:27.620
I'll fight it till it drops.

04:33.520 --> 04:34.580
So, what is the most important thing

04:36.200 --> 04:37.210
to you?

04:44.870 --> 04:45.530
I don't know.

04:50.870 --> 04:52.970
I hope this tower can tell me that.

04:57.230 --> 04:58.140
No matter

04:59.280 --> 05:00.380
what it is,

05:02.400 --> 05:03.700
I'll protect it for you.

05:11.760 --> 05:12.530
Master Zhang, look.

05:12.720 --> 05:13.290
It's like this.

05:14.760 --> 05:17.210
We came down to search for Unit 401.

05:18.350 --> 05:19.020
Soon,

05:19.640 --> 05:20.890
we found them.

05:21.430 --> 05:22.380
They were

05:22.430 --> 05:23.500
800 meters away from us.

05:24.520 --> 05:25.090
However,

05:25.600 --> 05:26.400
we couldn't catch up

05:26.760 --> 05:27.450
no matter how hard we tried.

05:28.790 --> 05:29.740
Until you

05:29.790 --> 05:30.650
ordered

05:31.080 --> 05:32.260
everyone to step back

05:33.230 --> 05:34.940
and blasted a hole

05:35.670 --> 05:36.380
in the floor,

05:36.520 --> 05:37.180
we finally found them.

05:38.840 --> 05:39.500
However, we realized

05:39.960 --> 05:40.820
the unit

05:41.110 --> 05:42.890
was controlled by a shadow.

05:43.520 --> 05:44.850
So, you went to chase after the shadow.

05:44.910 --> 05:45.530
Watch Unit 401!

05:45.530 --> 05:46.140
Laogou and I

05:46.350 --> 05:47.620
stayed behind to watch the unit.

05:48.550 --> 05:49.410
But this unit

05:50.080 --> 05:51.900
vanished before us

05:51.910 --> 05:52.920
once again.

05:55.040 --> 05:55.740
Where's Unit 401?

05:56.110 --> 05:58.060
Next, Laogou's men also vanished.

05:58.550 --> 06:00.380
So, we split up to look for them.

06:01.400 --> 06:02.370
Then,

06:02.670 --> 06:03.600
[Liunian Hall]
Liunian Hall

06:03.720 --> 06:05.530
suddenly appeared in the corridor.

06:05.960 --> 06:06.900
We went inside to find them

06:07.120 --> 06:07.840
but we failed.

06:08.870 --> 06:09.740
After that, we met you.

06:11.040 --> 06:11.530
A shadow

06:12.110 --> 06:13.090
controlled Unit 401?

06:15.230 --> 06:16.220
Unit 401

06:16.280 --> 06:18.270
arrived two days before us.

06:18.990 --> 06:20.180
Why would they appear

06:20.230 --> 06:21.520
and wait for us somewhere 800 meters away?

06:22.550 --> 06:23.650
Right.

06:25.230 --> 06:26.690
If they have been controlled by the shadow,

06:27.430 --> 06:28.980
then the shadow was actually waiting for us.

06:30.110 --> 06:31.130
I went to chase after the shadow.

06:31.760 --> 06:32.890
You went to search for Laogou's men.

06:33.670 --> 06:35.060
Why did we

06:35.870 --> 06:36.980
end up in the same place?

06:37.870 --> 06:38.620
Is this a coincidence?

06:39.670 --> 06:40.370
I see it now.

06:41.990 --> 06:43.930
This tower wants to lure us here.

06:44.550 --> 06:45.980
If this tower wants to lure us here,

06:46.790 --> 06:48.450
it just needs to use Unit 401.

06:49.060 --> 06:50.820
Making Unit 401 vanish and appear again.

06:51.470 --> 06:52.100
What's the point?

06:54.160 --> 06:54.930
But Master Zhang,

06:55.990 --> 06:57.780
monsters like this have no logic.

06:57.790 --> 06:59.370
It probably thinks it's fun.

06:59.910 --> 07:01.100
We are the toys.

07:01.230 --> 07:02.620
It won't give up

07:02.840 --> 07:04.180
until all of us are dead.

07:05.550 --> 07:06.660
This tower is only 80 years old.

07:07.350 --> 07:08.010
To put it bluntly,

07:08.520 --> 07:10.010
it has a shorter lifespan than humans. How did it become a monster?

07:10.040 --> 07:11.510
It must be working very hard.

07:12.640 --> 07:13.180
So?

07:14.430 --> 07:16.420
It works so hard just to fool around with us?

07:17.200 --> 07:18.330
That doesn't seem right.

07:19.280 --> 07:20.840
It lured me down here with Unit 401,

07:21.500 --> 07:22.940
captured Wu Laogou's men,

07:23.160 --> 07:24.290
and forced Laogou to enter deeper.

07:24.310 --> 07:25.300
It knows both of us very well.

07:26.520 --> 07:28.250
So, it must have done detailed research.

07:28.520 --> 07:29.860
This is clearly a calculated plot.

07:30.230 --> 07:31.660
Moreover, this person knows the Mystic Nine very well.

07:32.040 --> 07:33.690
I think it's not just against a few of our clans.

07:35.080 --> 07:37.370
Who is trying to harm the entire Mystic Nine?

07:47.300 --> 07:50.780
[Changsha Garrison Command]

07:57.960 --> 07:58.450
Commander,

07:58.990 --> 08:01.130
Ding Qiansui invites you to meet at the Taihe Pleasure House.

08:01.310 --> 08:01.980
I'm not going.

08:01.980 --> 08:02.990
[Huo Wenhai, Changsha Special Commissioner]

08:02.990 --> 08:05.370
A eunuch is asking you to meet him.

08:05.660 --> 08:06.490
Someone like him

08:06.640 --> 08:08.280
is trying to return to power

08:08.280 --> 08:09.780
just because he thinks he is rich.

08:10.230 --> 08:12.130
He is a useless remnant from the Qing Dynasty.

08:12.600 --> 08:14.350
However, the messenger said something else.

08:14.960 --> 08:15.690
Ding Qiansui

08:16.230 --> 08:18.100
can help you get rid of Zhang Qishan.

08:27.740 --> 08:28.490
Commander Huo,

08:29.200 --> 08:30.570
there's no need to take this filth's words

08:30.910 --> 08:32.010
seriously.

08:32.960 --> 08:35.140
Ding Qiansui is indeed a scum,

08:36.850 --> 08:38.100
but someone like him

08:38.100 --> 08:40.290
is exactly the kind who knows how to survive in harsh conditions.

08:41.680 --> 08:44.260
I'm a little interested in his schemes.

08:49.360 --> 08:49.730
Come.

08:50.550 --> 08:51.690
Let's go see what he's up to.

08:53.150 --> 08:54.730
- I am wronged! - Mercy, please.

08:54.730 --> 08:55.670
I am innocent!

08:55.910 --> 08:57.420
Commander Huo, spare us!

08:57.550 --> 08:59.480
We are innocent!

08:59.490 --> 09:00.770
Have mercy!

09:00.830 --> 09:02.810
- Commander Huo! - Commander Huo!

09:02.810 --> 09:04.450
Commander Huo, spare us!

09:04.590 --> 09:05.450
Commander Huo!

09:07.000 --> 09:08.660
Everyone! Guns up!

09:10.110 --> 09:10.570
Fire!

09:17.140 --> 09:22.140
[Changsha Garrison Command]

09:34.000 --> 09:37.610
I'm honored to have Commander Huo here.

09:37.670 --> 09:39.060
Commander Huo is busy.

09:39.480 --> 09:40.330
Make it quick.

09:41.590 --> 09:42.330
Go out.

09:50.190 --> 09:52.180
Commander Huo, come in and take a seat.

10:01.710 --> 10:02.810
Now, spill it out.

10:04.040 --> 10:05.020
Commander Huo.

10:06.760 --> 10:07.660
How's your relationship

10:07.960 --> 10:11.090
with Master Zhang?

10:13.880 --> 10:14.570
Trying to sow discord?

10:17.790 --> 10:19.140
Do you know I can execute you right now

10:20.040 --> 10:21.300
according to military law?

10:26.070 --> 10:27.780
However, I'll forget about this

10:28.120 --> 10:28.810
since we are from the same hometown.

10:30.190 --> 10:31.450
Commander Huo, stay.

10:32.760 --> 10:35.380
I spoke out of turn just now.

10:35.950 --> 10:36.660
However,

10:37.360 --> 10:39.380
the news I heard

10:40.160 --> 10:41.850
scares me.

10:45.160 --> 10:46.140
What news?

10:48.240 --> 10:49.210
Well,

10:51.430 --> 10:52.690
you know

10:54.640 --> 10:56.500
that the situation now is tense.

10:57.240 --> 10:59.500
The Japanese are keeping a close eye on the situation.

11:00.990 --> 11:02.310
Master Zhang,

11:02.310 --> 11:04.880
as the Defense Commander of Changsha,

11:05.310 --> 11:06.210
has achieved a lot

11:06.590 --> 11:09.780
in defending the city over the years.

11:10.830 --> 11:12.880
Everyone in the city...

11:12.880 --> 11:14.690
Cut to the chase.

11:15.400 --> 11:16.330
Yes.

11:17.590 --> 11:20.210
A few days ago, I received a report from my scouts

11:20.270 --> 11:22.430
saying that Master Zhang

11:22.430 --> 11:25.180
has all these achievements

11:26.190 --> 11:28.570
because the Japanese are involved.

11:30.640 --> 11:32.380
Of course, I didn't believe it.

11:33.120 --> 11:36.260
Master Zhang is the backbone of the Mystic Nine.

11:36.710 --> 11:39.060
If what I heard was true, then...

11:39.310 --> 11:42.060
Are you saying that Zhang Qishan is working with the Japanese?

11:43.000 --> 11:43.900
Commander Huo,

11:43.950 --> 11:45.300
I dare not say that.

11:46.670 --> 11:49.970
If my scout has evidence,

11:50.310 --> 11:50.850
then...

11:53.520 --> 11:55.140
If what you say is true,

11:55.950 --> 11:57.900
the Ministry of War will punish him accordingly.

11:58.070 --> 11:58.810
However,

12:01.160 --> 12:02.780
if you're just framing him for no reason,

12:03.120 --> 12:05.540
the Ministry of War also won't forgive you for spreading rumors.

12:05.790 --> 12:06.690
When the time comes,

12:07.550 --> 12:08.140
you'll be punished.

12:09.520 --> 12:10.630
When that happens,

12:11.900 --> 12:16.080
I'll surely visit you and apologize to you in person.

12:16.640 --> 12:17.500
Commander Huo,

12:17.880 --> 12:19.090
calm down.

12:19.390 --> 12:20.410
I know

12:20.730 --> 12:23.720
you and Zhang Qishan are both in the Ministry of War

12:23.970 --> 12:25.280
and have a strong bond.

12:25.730 --> 12:27.450
When you hear the news,

12:27.720 --> 12:30.330
you must find it hard to believe.

12:30.400 --> 12:31.420
I get it.

12:32.640 --> 12:34.570
If the news is true,

12:36.320 --> 12:39.090
the Ministry of War must be angry.

12:39.400 --> 12:41.140
My words carry little weight.

12:42.040 --> 12:43.780
I can only rely on someone of your standing

12:44.000 --> 12:46.380
to act as an intermediary.

12:47.790 --> 12:50.180
The Ministry of War also needs someone

12:50.670 --> 12:52.500
to take his spot.

12:54.120 --> 12:55.420
Am I right?

13:01.620 --> 13:03.070
[Zhang Qishan's Personal Information]

13:03.070 --> 13:04.500
The war is reaching a critical point,

13:04.880 --> 13:06.500
and you still need to deal with the Mystic Nine's sordid affairs?

13:07.640 --> 13:09.810
Let's ignore this bunch of misfits.

13:12.880 --> 13:14.300
I'm also a part of the Mystic Nine.

13:15.830 --> 13:17.020
Am I also a part of the misfits?

13:17.520 --> 13:18.210
No, Commander.

13:18.480 --> 13:19.020
Sorry.

13:20.590 --> 13:21.060
Forget it.

13:22.950 --> 13:23.810
Saying that

13:24.000 --> 13:25.060
means you don't understand the Mystic Nine.

13:25.120 --> 13:26.110
Back then,

13:26.430 --> 13:27.420
I could serve the Ministry of War

13:27.420 --> 13:28.800
as someone from the Mystic Nine.

13:28.830 --> 13:30.090
That means the Ministry of War

13:30.240 --> 13:31.500
still values the people

13:31.760 --> 13:32.450
from the Mystic Nine.

13:33.120 --> 13:35.180
There must be a reason why the Mystic Nine has remained in Changsha

13:35.400 --> 13:36.300
for so many years.

13:37.160 --> 13:38.810
Why don't we work with the Mystic Nine?

13:39.310 --> 13:39.810
I tried.

13:40.760 --> 13:41.300
There's no use.

13:42.430 --> 13:44.200
Each master of the Mystic Nine is highly skilled.

13:44.200 --> 13:45.020
They are so arrogant

13:45.310 --> 13:47.450
that they look down on each other.

13:47.760 --> 13:49.210
Why would they take orders from someone else?

13:51.550 --> 13:54.140
Only Zhang Qishan can make them obey him.

13:56.520 --> 13:57.610
Changsha is a place

13:59.070 --> 14:00.180
that looks calm on the surface

14:00.830 --> 14:01.450
but is full of dangers

14:02.190 --> 14:03.300
underneath.

14:04.670 --> 14:06.140
Every clan of the Mystic Nine is on the same boat.

14:07.400 --> 14:08.090
You don't need

14:09.000 --> 14:10.300
to row faster than others,

14:11.480 --> 14:13.330
but you need to keep this boat steady.

14:14.710 --> 14:15.610
Some obey the law.

14:17.520 --> 14:18.850
Some stand on the front line.

14:21.400 --> 14:22.420
Some are well-versed in worldly matters.

14:26.000 --> 14:27.260
Some are ambitious.

14:29.060 --> 14:30.090
We need everyone.

14:30.830 --> 14:31.660
That is how

14:32.160 --> 14:32.850
we can hold

14:33.550 --> 14:35.300
the fate of the situation in our hands.

14:37.520 --> 14:39.300
The Ministry of War isn't afraid of the Mystic Nine.

14:40.760 --> 14:42.130
However, the same cannot be said about the people

14:42.130 --> 14:42.900
in the Ministry of War.

14:43.310 --> 14:44.020
Today, you rise.

14:44.020 --> 14:44.880
Tomorrow, I fall.

14:44.880 --> 14:46.060
Everyone is trying to undermine each other.

14:46.430 --> 14:47.090
Everyone

14:47.090 --> 14:48.420
has asked the Mystic Nine for help.

14:49.160 --> 14:50.690
Naturally, the Mystic Nine

14:51.190 --> 14:52.500
has dirt on everyone in their hands.

14:53.950 --> 14:55.420
If they offend the Mystic Nine,

14:56.120 --> 14:58.210
all their secrets might be leaked one day.

14:59.520 --> 15:01.380
Doing that is no different from giving their enemies leverage.

15:04.180 --> 15:06.120
[Eryue Hong's Personal Information]

15:06.120 --> 15:07.420
Eryue Hong.

15:07.700 --> 15:10.910
[Pear Garden]

15:10.910 --> 15:13.080
The Hong Clan manages the city's grain transport.

15:13.440 --> 15:15.210
Their men are spread across all waterways.

15:16.000 --> 15:16.730
Eryue Hong's skill

15:16.880 --> 15:18.930
is being elusive.

15:19.520 --> 15:21.690
He can escape from anywhere.

15:22.950 --> 15:24.260
With this skill of his,

15:24.520 --> 15:26.610
he is also graceful and captivating on the stage.

15:27.910 --> 15:29.690
He is the most famous opera actor

15:29.910 --> 15:31.380
in the Changsha Flower Drum Opera Troupe.

15:32.400 --> 15:33.420
Whenever he sings,

15:33.790 --> 15:35.090
the place will be full.

15:35.090 --> 15:38.820
[Eryue Hong, Hong Clan of Mystic Nine]

15:42.710 --> 15:44.380
Although Eryue Hong left the Mystic Nine

15:44.670 --> 15:46.140
after his wife's death,

15:48.120 --> 15:49.970
his reputation and assets still exist.

15:54.360 --> 15:55.330
Eryue Hong

15:57.280 --> 15:58.330
is the most unfathomable

15:58.360 --> 15:59.690
and hardest to deal with.

16:00.400 --> 16:02.060
If Zhang Qishan were dead,

16:02.190 --> 16:03.540
the news could stay hidden for a few days.

16:05.190 --> 16:07.090
But if a famous figure like him were to die,

16:07.280 --> 16:08.020
all of Changsha

16:08.400 --> 16:10.660
and even the whole country would be shocked within half a day.

16:11.160 --> 16:13.090
Then, Mystic Nine will be alert.

16:13.430 --> 16:14.570
It'll be even harder

16:14.590 --> 16:15.900
to take them down one by one.

16:18.240 --> 16:19.140
Banjie Li.

16:19.140 --> 16:20.790
[Banjie Li's Personal Information]

16:20.790 --> 16:21.850
This guy just won't die.

16:22.200 --> 16:23.280
Third Master.

16:23.280 --> 16:25.500
Both his legs were broken by his partners when he was young.

16:26.120 --> 16:27.660
He was trapped in the ditch for a week,

16:27.780 --> 16:29.610
[Banjie Li, Li Clan of Mystic Nine]
- Third Master. - surviving on muddy water.

16:29.670 --> 16:30.180
Wait.

16:31.120 --> 16:33.330
He is the most ruthless person in Mystic Nine.

16:34.670 --> 16:35.810
He is very suspicious.

16:36.880 --> 16:37.980
- Thank you, Third Master.
- Rumor has it

16:37.980 --> 16:39.850
- Let me help you.
- that he sleeps in a tomb every night

16:40.710 --> 16:42.240
because he doesn't trust the living.

16:42.240 --> 16:42.900
Third Master.

16:44.640 --> 16:47.330
- Third Master.
- He manages the lowest class here.

16:50.000 --> 16:51.570
- Almost all the beggars
- Thank you, Third Master.

16:51.590 --> 16:54.020
- and the disabled rely on him to live.
- Thank you, Third Master.

16:54.890 --> 16:57.200
He has spies at every corner.

17:07.130 --> 17:07.810
Let's go take a look.

17:11.110 --> 17:12.410
If Banjie Li is killed,

17:13.150 --> 17:15.220
the people will cause trouble in the streets.

17:16.240 --> 17:18.260
When the government can't handle it,

17:20.000 --> 17:21.980
it'll still affect the Ministry of War.

17:26.720 --> 17:27.460
Fourth Master.

17:27.460 --> 17:28.060
[Fourth Master's Personal Information]

17:29.310 --> 17:30.130
This man

17:30.280 --> 17:31.850
used to study under Eryue Hong.

17:32.200 --> 17:33.500
Later, he betrayed him and was chased out.

17:34.550 --> 17:35.980
Not only can he use iron pellets,

17:36.440 --> 17:37.850
but the nine-claw hook he created

17:38.070 --> 17:40.220
can also kill easily.

17:41.200 --> 17:42.060
He is the most inhumane one

17:42.110 --> 17:43.780
among the Mystic Nine.

17:44.720 --> 17:45.850
There's no right and wrong to him.

17:45.850 --> 17:47.130
He only does what he likes best

17:47.130 --> 17:48.650
[Chen Pi Asi, Fourth Master of Mystic Nine]
without considering the consequences.

17:49.000 --> 17:50.410
Whether you are a high-ranking official,

17:50.410 --> 17:51.700
or a foreign dignitary,

17:51.700 --> 17:52.810
if you offend him,

17:52.810 --> 17:54.260
he will try to kill you

17:54.310 --> 17:55.410
even if it costs his life.

17:55.790 --> 17:57.980
You must make sure you kill him in one attempt.

17:58.200 --> 18:00.460
Otherwise, you'll be in deep trouble in the future.

18:01.850 --> 18:02.650
Laogou.

18:02.650 --> 18:03.680
[Wu Laogou's Personal Information]

18:03.680 --> 18:05.410
He is the only crack in Mystic Nine.

18:06.310 --> 18:08.060
He hasn't joined Mystic Nine for long,

18:08.060 --> 18:09.610
but he hates Zhang Qishan a lot.

18:10.480 --> 18:11.570
He is decisive in killing

18:11.570 --> 18:12.980
and great at scheming.

18:14.520 --> 18:16.460
Most importantly, he holds grudges easily.

18:16.960 --> 18:17.810
His blade

18:18.280 --> 18:20.410
is already pointing at Zhang Qishan.

18:24.440 --> 18:26.940
[Heibei Laoliu, Sixth Master of Mystic Nine]
Laoliu was a swordsman of Shaanxi.

18:28.040 --> 18:29.220
He likes to act alone.

18:30.070 --> 18:31.130
It's possible

18:31.200 --> 18:32.410
to kill him,

18:33.550 --> 18:35.260
but his swordsmanship is impeccable.

18:35.280 --> 18:37.170
He can kill someone in one strike.

18:38.390 --> 18:39.130
Many people

18:39.310 --> 18:41.330
wanted to kill him and take over his position over the years,

18:41.870 --> 18:43.300
but none has succeeded.

18:45.100 --> 18:46.550
[Huo Xiangu's Personal Information]

18:46.550 --> 18:47.330
Xiangu.

18:49.550 --> 18:50.810
She's from my family.

18:51.680 --> 18:53.570
I still want to protect her, if possible.

18:54.280 --> 18:54.980
Of course,

18:56.040 --> 18:57.740
if Huo Xiangu has a backbone,

18:59.520 --> 19:01.410
let her die together with the Huo clan.

19:03.760 --> 19:06.130
However, if she insists on going her own way,

19:07.480 --> 19:09.130
I don't think the women of my family

19:09.310 --> 19:10.460
would listen to her.

19:11.300 --> 19:13.240
[Qi Tiezui's Personal Information]
Tiezui.

19:13.240 --> 19:16.020
He knows everything in the world.

19:16.240 --> 19:17.490
When I wanted to kill him,

19:17.490 --> 19:19.390
he left Changsha immediately.

19:19.790 --> 19:21.700
[Masterful Divination]
I didn't know how he found out.

19:22.110 --> 19:23.470
However, his skills

19:23.470 --> 19:24.740
are by no means ordinary.

19:28.620 --> 19:30.590
[Xie Jiu]

19:30.590 --> 19:31.650
Jiu.

19:33.110 --> 19:36.130
He is close to every faction.

19:36.630 --> 19:37.410
He's troublesome.

19:39.110 --> 19:40.500
I need to keep him in check first.

19:41.040 --> 19:41.630
Otherwise,

19:41.630 --> 19:43.540
this whole thing will get complicated.

19:44.720 --> 19:46.370
However, I can't do anything to him directly.

19:47.880 --> 19:49.410
He has many business dealings

19:49.410 --> 19:50.770
with the high-ranking officials in the Ministry of War.

19:50.930 --> 19:52.540
I can't afford to offend any of them.

20:55.070 --> 20:56.410
It's Runty's collar.

21:09.200 --> 21:10.260
Master, it's safe.

21:11.960 --> 21:12.650
Get ready to depart.

21:14.760 --> 21:15.830
Did your turtle

21:15.830 --> 21:17.130
get eaten by the monster

21:17.720 --> 21:19.500
and the monster is now plucking the rope?

21:19.680 --> 21:21.170
The monster doesn't know the Zhang Clan's secret code.

21:21.790 --> 21:22.260
Tiezui.

21:23.920 --> 21:24.330
Master Zhang.

21:25.310 --> 21:25.610
Master Zhang.

21:26.240 --> 21:27.170
Are you coming with us or are you staying?

21:28.000 --> 21:29.500
Of course, I'm following.

21:30.280 --> 21:31.000
You've changed.

21:31.480 --> 21:32.500
When the Mystic Nine was formed,

21:32.520 --> 21:34.170
I swore to go through everything together.

21:35.040 --> 21:36.330
I'm eighth in the Mystic Nine.

21:36.960 --> 21:37.960
How can I be a coward

21:37.960 --> 21:38.890
at a time like this?

21:39.760 --> 21:41.200
Did you do a divination behind our backs?

21:41.200 --> 21:43.780
Nonsense. I'm being a good friend now.

21:46.520 --> 21:47.220
Get ready.

21:47.590 --> 21:48.460
We'll leave in five minutes.

21:48.480 --> 21:49.060
- Yes! - Yes!

22:11.780 --> 22:12.740
Master Zhang.

22:13.350 --> 22:14.540
Are you there, Master Zhang?

22:26.790 --> 22:27.410
Laogou.

22:28.350 --> 22:29.460
Are you there, Laogou?

22:32.390 --> 22:33.130
Master Zhang.

22:34.480 --> 22:35.650
Master Zhang, are you there?

22:36.960 --> 22:38.460
Say something.

22:39.630 --> 22:40.410
Are you there?

22:41.350 --> 22:42.000
Laogou.

22:46.310 --> 22:47.090
All right.

22:48.680 --> 22:49.700
I'm glad that we're all here.

23:04.480 --> 23:05.500
Let's have a chat.

23:06.590 --> 23:07.550
It's rare

23:07.550 --> 23:08.980
for the three all-rounder clans to gather.

23:10.070 --> 23:10.890
We are

23:11.370 --> 23:12.940
good at literary arts, martial arts,

23:13.480 --> 23:14.610
and even scheming.

23:15.480 --> 23:17.540
It's the ultimate combination.

23:18.390 --> 23:19.060
Shut up.

24:23.520 --> 24:24.810
Why are there so many skulls here?

24:25.520 --> 24:27.300
Obviously, they buried humans in the foundation

24:27.920 --> 24:29.170
when they built this.

24:30.070 --> 24:31.090
The bones are still intact,

24:31.520 --> 24:32.410
and the joints have not come apart.

24:33.150 --> 24:34.410
This doesn't look like natural decomposition.

24:42.630 --> 24:44.220
Xiaojin, bring one along.

24:45.000 --> 24:45.330
Yes.

25:02.110 --> 25:02.890
I didn't find them.

25:03.790 --> 25:04.610
But I found this.

25:08.870 --> 25:09.610
Runty.

25:13.000 --> 25:13.460
Runty!

25:20.960 --> 25:22.020
- Tianpeng! - Zhenyuan!

25:22.130 --> 25:22.750
Tianpeng!

25:24.590 --> 25:25.220
Tianpeng!

25:25.870 --> 25:26.540
Zhenyuan!

25:27.040 --> 25:27.700
- Zhenyuan! - Master Zhang.

25:27.720 --> 25:28.100
Zhenyuan!

25:28.480 --> 25:29.170
I've investigated this place.

25:29.760 --> 25:31.270
This is a completely sealed space.

25:31.480 --> 25:32.330
I'm sure they were here,

25:33.040 --> 25:34.090
but they vanished somehow.

25:35.310 --> 25:36.300
There's something sinister about this place.

25:47.590 --> 25:47.980
Master Zhang.

25:48.480 --> 25:49.220
I brought the skull.

26:34.390 --> 26:35.700
Did you see anything strange

26:36.630 --> 26:38.410
at the waterway just now?

26:41.830 --> 26:42.740
Are you talking about the skulls?

26:44.040 --> 26:45.650
That shouldn't be surprising to you.

26:51.070 --> 26:52.460
Did you see something else?

26:53.790 --> 26:54.170
Forget it.

26:55.070 --> 26:55.980
I probably made a mistake.

26:57.350 --> 26:58.330
You'd never make a mistake.

27:00.520 --> 27:01.410
Let me tell you honestly.

27:02.680 --> 27:04.260
This place is eerie.

27:05.280 --> 27:06.500
The smaller the details, the more important they are.

27:09.760 --> 27:10.890
Just tell me.

27:12.040 --> 27:13.130
Otherwise, you'd feel like

27:13.150 --> 27:13.980
there's a weight in your heart.

27:14.580 --> 27:15.610
You think I don't care about you,

27:16.610 --> 27:17.020
right?

27:20.310 --> 27:21.060
Tell me.

27:26.070 --> 27:27.740
Just now, near the skulls,

27:28.920 --> 27:31.020
I saw a very strange window.

27:31.790 --> 27:32.650
Someone was standing inside.

27:33.520 --> 27:34.220
That man

27:35.480 --> 27:36.780
looked a lot like the Otherworld Patriarch.

27:43.070 --> 27:44.780
If he dares to harm you,

27:45.200 --> 27:46.130
I chop him up

27:46.130 --> 27:47.330
and mix him with the foundation of the building.

27:47.760 --> 27:48.980
You don't need to worry about me.

27:49.960 --> 27:51.370
I will protect myself.

27:59.960 --> 28:00.850
Did you notice anything?

28:06.200 --> 28:07.650
This hand comes out from the mouth.

28:09.960 --> 28:11.890
This head comes out from the stomach.

28:12.480 --> 28:13.260
All these body parts

28:13.830 --> 28:15.220
are mixed together.

28:16.280 --> 28:17.540
They are not from this world.

28:31.000 --> 28:31.460
Master Zhang.

28:34.110 --> 28:35.170
This hand isn't a broken limb.

28:35.350 --> 28:36.020
It has flesh on it

28:36.150 --> 28:37.570
and goes deep into the abdominal cavity.

28:38.350 --> 28:39.570
Moreover, this body didn't have external injuries.

28:40.240 --> 28:41.610
It doesn't seem like it has been planted from the outside.

28:42.760 --> 28:44.260
It's like the hand grew from inside the body.

28:44.520 --> 28:45.570
Check all bodies.

28:46.440 --> 28:47.410
If it's manmade,

28:47.870 --> 28:48.610
there will be an indicator.

28:49.040 --> 28:49.370
Yes.

29:12.520 --> 29:13.020
Fifth Master,

29:13.870 --> 29:14.700
we investigated everything.

29:15.070 --> 29:16.650
This place is completely sealed.

29:19.450 --> 29:20.040
Fifth Master.

29:20.790 --> 29:21.650
This hall

29:22.310 --> 29:24.700
is exactly the same as the previous one,

29:25.110 --> 29:27.020
but this one is a lot older.

29:29.110 --> 29:30.090
As in?

29:30.920 --> 29:31.850
Is it one year older or a decade older?

29:32.240 --> 29:33.060
Give me a number.

29:34.550 --> 29:35.130
Fifth Master,

29:35.680 --> 29:37.330
this brick is a mix of old lime, clay, and sand.

29:37.870 --> 29:39.260
Gray nails are used between the cracks.

29:39.350 --> 29:40.220
No stone powder is added.

29:40.800 --> 29:42.220
They are built through grouting of dry joints.

29:42.830 --> 29:43.610
A technique like this

29:44.590 --> 29:46.700
is from either the early Ming dynasty or the late Yuan Dynasty.

29:47.870 --> 29:48.610
Where are

29:48.960 --> 29:49.980
Tianpeng and the rest, then?

29:51.200 --> 29:52.090
The building outside is new,

29:53.150 --> 29:54.090
but this building is old?

30:02.520 --> 30:03.090
Oh, no.

30:03.760 --> 30:04.650
I see it now.

30:30.870 --> 30:31.410
What's going on?

30:31.950 --> 30:32.470
I...

30:34.550 --> 30:35.460
I just wanted

30:35.680 --> 30:37.370
to make a divination, and the jade pendant fell.

30:40.650 --> 30:41.460
Master Zhang.

30:42.340 --> 30:43.790
I know what's going on

30:43.790 --> 30:45.890
but I dare not say it.

30:49.870 --> 30:50.410
Don't be afraid.

30:51.390 --> 30:52.020
I am here.

30:53.340 --> 30:54.650
A ritual took place here.

30:54.910 --> 30:57.380
It's called the Three Primes Sun-Moon Great Peace Fasting Rite.

30:57.380 --> 30:57.990
Tiezui,

30:58.910 --> 31:00.130
remember to be concise.

31:00.920 --> 31:01.570
All right.

31:01.830 --> 31:02.890
Sure.

31:06.110 --> 31:06.980
This ritual

31:08.000 --> 31:09.370
was used to open

31:09.520 --> 31:10.890
the gates to Heaven.

31:11.310 --> 31:12.850
A gate will be opened here

31:13.000 --> 31:14.090
that goes directly to Heaven.

31:14.240 --> 31:16.030
However, a problem seemed to have happened.

31:32.070 --> 31:33.180
The cause of the problem

31:33.390 --> 31:35.060
is probably the symbol on this flag.

31:35.680 --> 31:36.540
The symbol on it

31:36.830 --> 31:38.610
has been changed into the symbol of a cult.

31:41.720 --> 31:42.330
A cult?

31:45.000 --> 31:45.810
The ritual failed

31:46.440 --> 31:47.650
and all of them died.

31:54.240 --> 31:55.370
Stop spouting nonsense here.

31:56.520 --> 31:57.370
A failed ritual

31:57.390 --> 31:58.370
will never kill.

32:00.140 --> 32:00.650
Laogou.

32:00.840 --> 32:03.630
This spell opens a gate to Heaven.

32:03.720 --> 32:04.610
If the flag is wrong,

32:04.680 --> 32:05.060
the gate

32:05.790 --> 32:07.570
probably doesn't lead to Heaven, first of all.

32:08.550 --> 32:09.060
Second,

32:09.870 --> 32:10.780
where the door leads to

32:11.280 --> 32:12.370
is unknown.

32:26.040 --> 32:27.170
Although they didn't go to Heaven,

32:27.920 --> 32:29.650
the Otherworld Patriarch proved that he could use spells.

32:30.000 --> 32:30.850
He just didn't excel in it.

32:31.590 --> 32:32.460
He has achieved his goal, more or less.

32:33.070 --> 32:34.220
It is all fake.

32:37.960 --> 32:39.610
The only objective of the Otherworld Tower

32:40.440 --> 32:41.740
is to let the followers believe

32:42.740 --> 32:43.940
that spells truly exist.

32:44.520 --> 32:46.330
Throughout history, all this talk of spirits and the supernatural

32:47.590 --> 32:49.090
has been used to deceive the world.

32:50.200 --> 32:52.330
I, Zhang Qishan, swear with my life,

32:53.920 --> 32:56.740
that everything here is a lie.

33:02.590 --> 33:03.020
Tiezui,

33:04.790 --> 33:06.120
if you have more proof to convince me,

33:06.120 --> 33:07.000
show me.

33:07.610 --> 33:08.410
If you can't,

33:08.920 --> 33:10.520
I'll crush this place.

33:11.400 --> 33:12.300
Master Zhang, I...

33:14.960 --> 33:16.130
Yes, Master Zhang.

33:16.480 --> 33:17.740
I'll surely find evidence for you.

33:25.830 --> 33:26.370
Over there.

33:26.920 --> 33:28.090
Only a hand and a head

33:28.520 --> 33:29.130
passed through

33:29.680 --> 33:30.890
and the passage was closed.

33:31.630 --> 33:32.570
The hand and head

33:32.920 --> 33:34.810
were severed in the bodies of these followers.

33:35.390 --> 33:36.540
But look at this body.

33:37.240 --> 33:38.300
It is complete

33:38.680 --> 33:39.540
with the mouth open.

33:39.920 --> 33:41.300
However, there's nothing inside.

33:41.550 --> 33:42.220
That means

33:42.550 --> 33:43.170
at least,

33:43.350 --> 33:45.060
something made its way here successfully.

33:45.310 --> 33:46.740
It must be the shadow you chased after.

33:47.110 --> 33:48.460
The shadow was here for a long time?

33:49.520 --> 33:50.890
The ritual was carried out years ago,

33:51.070 --> 33:51.780
but it only harms people recently?

33:53.000 --> 33:54.020
What has the shadow been doing all this time?

33:55.150 --> 33:56.060
How would I know?

33:56.310 --> 33:57.170
Perhaps the shadow

33:57.630 --> 33:59.220
was still young when it just came here.

33:59.310 --> 34:00.740
It has only become an adult recently.

34:00.920 --> 34:01.500
Whether it's a human

34:02.310 --> 34:03.060
or a spirit,

34:04.070 --> 34:05.220
regardless of its objective

34:05.790 --> 34:06.700
or what it wants us to do,

34:07.390 --> 34:08.650
I will never let it get its wish.

35:03.960 --> 35:04.860
Master Qiansui.

35:04.900 --> 35:05.670
The building...

35:06.320 --> 35:07.940
The building is shaking.

35:08.450 --> 35:09.410
Don't be afraid.

35:11.810 --> 35:15.860
The more it shakes, the more it feels comfortable.

35:21.590 --> 35:22.380
Master.

35:22.730 --> 35:27.610
The unions and farewells of life are impossible to foresee.

35:29.040 --> 35:34.770
Let us watch the splendid play that unfolds this day.

35:45.000 --> 35:45.340
Help

35:45.800 --> 35:46.490
dig the waterway.

35:46.490 --> 35:46.980
- Yes! - Yes!

35:47.040 --> 35:47.460
Don't move.

35:48.110 --> 35:49.290
It might collapse again.

35:56.880 --> 35:57.380
Master Zhang.

35:58.240 --> 35:59.940
This is a common deep rock fracture.

36:00.520 --> 36:01.570
The layers underneath have been flattened.

36:02.070 --> 36:03.090
This road is definitely blocked.

36:17.440 --> 36:18.860
I get it now!

36:19.590 --> 36:20.570
I get it now!

36:29.280 --> 36:31.230
We are trapped here forever.

36:33.630 --> 36:34.290
I get it now!

36:42.590 --> 36:43.210
Speak.

36:47.520 --> 36:49.130
We are trapped here.

36:50.630 --> 36:51.610
The only waterway

36:52.070 --> 36:53.130
has collapsed.

36:56.360 --> 36:57.090
We can't leave.

36:57.960 --> 36:59.540
The only way to leave this place

36:59.880 --> 37:01.250
is to carry out the Three Primes Sun-Moon Great Peace Fasting Rite

37:02.000 --> 37:03.020
to connect to the other world.

37:03.850 --> 37:05.360
Then, there might still be a chance.

37:09.270 --> 37:09.940
Otherworld Patriarch.

37:10.380 --> 37:10.860
No.

37:11.240 --> 37:12.420
You are probably the shadow.

37:12.920 --> 37:13.690
Come out.

37:14.150 --> 37:14.980
I know you're here.

37:16.880 --> 37:17.860
You used Unit 401

37:18.590 --> 37:19.940
to lure us here

37:20.630 --> 37:22.690
because you want us to carry out the ritual to send you home.

37:22.760 --> 37:23.210
No need.

37:23.320 --> 37:24.340
Unit 401 was already here.

37:24.400 --> 37:25.650
Just let them carry out the ritual.

37:26.330 --> 37:27.170
Wu Laogou,

37:28.220 --> 37:29.570
don't run your mouth.

37:32.000 --> 37:32.690
Besides,

37:32.850 --> 37:34.460
my dogs are not required for the ritual.

37:35.000 --> 37:35.860
Return my dogs first.

37:39.880 --> 37:40.900
All of you don't believe me.

37:41.440 --> 37:42.500
All of you are looking down on me.

37:43.520 --> 37:44.940
Why don't we follow Tiezui's method first?

37:48.590 --> 37:49.250
The people of the Wu Clan should do it first.

37:49.690 --> 37:50.700
We'll take responsibility if all of you die.

37:50.700 --> 37:51.420
Ridiculous!

37:56.300 --> 37:57.690
It'll take three years

37:58.150 --> 37:59.250
for you to learn the spell now.

37:59.520 --> 38:00.860
Don't underestimate my expertise.

38:01.040 --> 38:02.020
It's not that easy.

38:07.040 --> 38:07.730
Take him away.

38:07.800 --> 38:09.060
Dream on.

38:12.190 --> 38:13.210
Tiezui has gone mad.

38:13.880 --> 38:15.460
What do you think, Master Zhang?

38:16.750 --> 38:17.820
You don't believe in the supernatural.

38:18.110 --> 38:19.490
Carrying out a ritual is probably

38:19.490 --> 38:20.380
beneath you.

38:21.190 --> 38:22.540
Let me do it on your behalf.

38:23.750 --> 38:24.940
No need. We'll do it together.

38:25.320 --> 38:26.020
Just don't tell anyone after we escape.

38:27.400 --> 38:27.860
Everyone,

38:29.190 --> 38:29.900
prepare for the ritual.

38:31.270 --> 38:32.420
Help Tiezui get changed.

38:56.630 --> 38:58.900
Everyone, pay attention to Tiezui's steps and rhythm.

39:00.070 --> 39:00.630
If the tower

39:00.630 --> 39:02.560
is hinting at us to carry out this ritual,

39:03.960 --> 39:05.820
while Tiezui is carrying out the ritual,

39:06.710 --> 39:08.250
his feet might step on some traps

39:08.630 --> 39:09.900
that create illusions.

39:23.190 --> 39:23.690
That's all?

39:25.480 --> 39:25.820
That's all.

39:27.270 --> 39:27.980
That's all?

39:32.230 --> 39:32.770
Where's the gate?

39:33.800 --> 39:34.380
Where is it?

39:43.590 --> 39:44.650
The gate...

40:11.070 --> 40:11.690
Master,

40:13.040 --> 40:13.820
there's nothing inside.

40:23.000 --> 40:28.650
- Master! - Master!

40:28.800 --> 40:29.690
Master!

40:32.710 --> 40:33.380
Master!

40:34.610 --> 40:35.280
Master!

40:40.550 --> 40:41.610
The gate has indeed opened.

40:43.110 --> 40:44.610
Zhang Qishan did go there.

40:46.070 --> 40:47.340
Why wasn't there any sound?

40:51.230 --> 40:51.730
Tiezui.

40:53.400 --> 40:54.650
Help me do another ritual.

40:55.550 --> 40:56.340
No, Fifth Master.

40:56.520 --> 40:57.730
Exactly. Even Master Zhang is gone.

40:57.750 --> 40:58.690
Since Zhang Qishan went there,

40:59.190 --> 40:59.980
Tianpeng and the rest

41:00.710 --> 41:01.770
might have gone there too.

41:02.710 --> 41:03.820
I must take a look.

41:05.040 --> 41:06.090
Otherwise, the Wu Clan

41:06.750 --> 41:07.940
will be looked down upon by the Zhang Clan.

41:08.750 --> 41:09.860
We promised to help them find Unit 401.

41:09.880 --> 41:11.090
In the end, we failed

41:11.590 --> 41:12.730
and Zhang Qishan has gone missing.

41:13.750 --> 41:14.730
Even if we can return alive,

41:15.920 --> 41:17.420
I'll be too embarrassed to stay in Changsha.

41:18.400 --> 41:19.900
What nonsense ritual.

41:20.840 --> 41:22.340
Let me experience it.

41:23.520 --> 41:24.860
Everyone, be on standby here.

41:25.590 --> 41:26.460
If I find something,

41:26.960 --> 41:28.060
I'll try to send a message back here.

41:29.070 --> 41:31.020
Tiezui, carry out the ritual.

